K71IyeWHc6spEKB.jpg","person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap304","person_name":"Gregory La Cava","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}],"in_collection":null}],"edges":[{"source":"aw36","target":"aw105","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"Often viewed as a camp reinterpretation of 'All About Eve,' the film follows a ruthless newcomer who claws her way to the top of the Las Vegas showgirl hierarchy, mirroring Eve's trajectory in a far more lurid and explicit manner.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw66","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"Cassavetes' film explores similar themes of an aging stage actress facing a professional and personal crisis, echoing Margo Channing's anxieties about her career and identity.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw67","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The psychological thriller translates the 'All About Eve' dynamic of a veteran performer and an ambitious, duplicitous understudy to the competitive world of professional ballet.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw68","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The film mirrors the mentor-protégé relationship turning into a rivalry, with a naive but ambitious young woman learning from and eventually challenging a powerful, established figure in a glamorous industry.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw65","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Released the same year, both films offer a cynical, darkly witty critique of show business and the perils of aging within it, featuring iconic performances by legendary actresses of a previous era.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw64","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"This earlier film established the popular narrative of an established star being supplanted by a rising newcomer, a central theme echoed and expanded upon in All About Eve.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw103","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"While a romantic comedy, its sophisticated, rapid-fire dialogue and sharp social satire, written by Donald Ogden Stewart from Philip Barry's play, provided a model for the verbally dexterous and witty screenplay Mankiewicz crafted.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw104","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Mankiewicz refined his use of multiple-perspective narration and flashback in this earlier film, a structural device he perfected in 'All About Eve' to reveal the characters' complex motivations and differing perceptions of Eve.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw36","target":"aw102","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"This film, about a group of aspiring actresses living in a theatrical boarding house, established a template for backstage dramas focused on female competition and camaraderie that 'All About Eve' masterfully built upon.","direction":"outgoing"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw36","aw36","aw36","aw36","aw36","aw36","aw36","aw36","aw36"],"influences":[]},"stats":{"total_connected":9,"influences_count":5,"influenced_count":4,"filter":"all","vault_count":0,"beyond_count":9}}